		'Steep climbs and descents that are part rollercoaster, part landscape tour. Tell your driver if you’d prefer a gentler ride.' => '陡峭的上坡和下坡，一半像过山车，一半像风景巡游。如果你想要更温和一些，请告诉司机。',
