		'Sun protection, sunglasses and water; swimwear and a towel for the springs; and a warm layer, because it gets cold quickly after sunset, especially in winter.' => '防晒用品、太阳镜和水；泡泉用的泳衣和毛巾；还有一件保暖外套，因为日落后气温下降很快，冬天尤其如此。',
