		'Team is online' => '团队在线',
		'Tell the operator about allergies and dietary needs. Vegetarian eating is easy in Egypt, since many classics are meat-free.' => '把过敏和饮食需求告诉经营者。在埃及吃素很容易，许多经典菜式本来就不含肉。',
		'Terms' => '条款',
		'Thank you — please check your inbox to confirm your subscription.' => '谢谢！请查收邮件以确认订阅。',
		'Thanks! We’ll reply here as soon as we can. You can close this window and come back later.' => '谢谢！我们会尽快在这里回复。您可以关闭此窗口，稍后再回来查看。',
		'The 15th-century sea fort built on the site of the ancient Pharos lighthouse, reusing its stone.' => '15世纪的海上要塞，建在古代法罗斯灯塔的旧址上，并重新利用了灯塔的石料。',
		'The Bibliotheca Alexandrina' => '亚历山大图书馆',
		'The Black Desert' => '黑沙漠',
		'The Citadel of Qaitbay' => '盖贝依城堡',
		'The Corniche and Montaza' => '滨海大道与蒙塔扎',
		'The GetYourGuide option asks you to bring your passport or ID card.' => 'GetYourGuide 选项要求您携带护照或身份证。',
		'The Giftun Islands and nearby reefs.' => '吉夫顿岛和附近的珊瑚礁。',
		'The Grand Egyptian Museum' => '大埃及博物馆',
		'The Great Pyramid' => '大金字塔',
		'The Great Pyramid is the only surviving Wonder of the Ancient World.' => '大金字塔是古代世界奇迹中唯一留存至今的一个。',
		'The Great Pyramid of Khufu is the only surviving Wonder of the Ancient World. Beside it stand the pyramids of Khafre and Menkaure.' => '胡夫大金字塔是古代世界奇迹中唯一留存至今的一个。它旁边是哈夫拉和孟卡拉金字塔。',
		'The Great Sphinx lies below the pyramids, by the valley temple.' => '狮身人面像位于金字塔下方，紧邻河谷神庙。',
		'The Nile' => '尼罗河',
		'The Nile draws a single line of life through the desert. Everything else — the coasts, the oases, the ancient cities — is a short flight or a scenic drive away.' => '尼罗河在沙漠中划出一条唯一的生命线。其余的一切——海岸、绿洲、古城——都只需一段短途航班或一条风景公路。',
		'The Roamer Journal' => 'Roamer 旅行志',
		'The Shali fortress, the Oracle of Amun and Cleopatra’s Spring in the oasis itself. See our Siwa guide.' => '绿洲里的沙利古城、阿蒙神谕神庙和克娄巴特拉泉。请看我们的锡瓦指南。',
		'The Sphinx' => '狮身人面像',
		'The Temple of Horus at Edfu is one of the best-preserved temples in Egypt. It was begun under Ptolemy III in 237 BC and completed in 57 BC.' => '埃德富的荷鲁斯神庙是埃及保存最完好的神庙之一，始建于公元前237年托勒密三世时期，完工于公元前57年。',
		'The Viator options leave Aswan on Monday, Wednesday or Friday.' => 'Viator的选项在周一、周三或周五从阿斯旺出发。',
		'The West Bank below' => '脚下的西岸',
		'The West Bank from above' => '从空中看西岸',
		'The White Desert' => '白沙漠',
		'The ancient Egyptians called it Ipet-Sut, “the Most Select of Places”. Its Great Temple of Amun has a hypostyle hall of 134 columns.' => '古埃及人称它为 Ipet-Sut，意为“最精选之地”。其阿蒙大神庙有一座由 134 根石柱组成的多柱厅。',
		'The best food has no English menu' => '最好吃的东西没有英文菜单',
		'The best food in Cairo is in places without menus in English, and often without signs at all. A guide knows where to go, orders for you, explains the dishes, and handles hygiene questions.' => '开罗最好吃的东西，往往藏在没有英文菜单、甚至连招牌都没有的地方。导游知道该去哪里，会替你点菜、讲解菜式，并帮你留意卫生问题。',
		'The boat sails to the first site. The guide explains the dive plan, the depth and what you might see.' => '船开往第一个潜点。导游讲解潜水计划、深度，以及可能看到的生物。',
		'The classic Siwa excursion' => '锡瓦的经典行程',
		'The classic route' => '经典航线',
		'The contrast of desert and sea is part of the experience.' => '沙漠与大海的反差也是这趟体验的一部分。',
		'The day, step by step' => '一天的行程，一步步来',
		'The day, stop by stop' => '这一天，一站一站',
		'The desert behind the coast' => '海岸背后的沙漠',
		'The drive to Luxor takes about 4.5 hours each way, according to the GetYourGuide option’s itinerary.' => '根据 GetYourGuide 选项的行程，前往卢克索单程约需 4.5 小时。',
		'The essential West Bank day' => '西岸必游的一天',
		'The façade of the Great Temple is one of the most famous images of ancient Egypt, and it’s even bigger in person.' => '大神庙的正面是古埃及最著名的形象之一，亲眼所见比想象中更加宏大。',
		'The interiors' => '内部',
		'The lakes and waterfalls of Wadi El-Rayan, formed by drainage water from the farmland of the Fayoum.' => '瓦迪拉扬的湖泊和瀑布，由法尤姆农田的排水汇聚而成。',
		'The link may be old, or the page is not published yet. Try a search, or start from one of these.' => '链接可能已失效，或页面尚未发布。请尝试搜索，或从以下入口开始。',
