		'The option on this page also stops at Tunis village and includes lunch in the Fayoum, according to the partner’s page.' => '根据合作伙伴页面，本页的选项还会停靠突尼斯村，并包含在法尤姆的午餐。',
		'The option on this page picks you up at your hotel in Marsa Alam and drives into the park by 4×4, with a guide and lunch, according to the partner’s page. Check what is included on the partner’s page before you book.' => '根据合作伙伴页面，本页的选项包含从你在马萨阿拉姆的酒店接送，乘四驱车进入公园，并配有导游和午餐。预订前请在合作伙伴页面上确认包含的内容。',
		'The options on this page last about 4 days and 3 nights, from Aswan to Luxor.' => '本页的选项大约为期4天3晚，从阿斯旺到卢克索。',
		'The order of the visits can change with the flight times and Cairo’s traffic.' => '参观顺序可能会根据航班时间和开罗的交通情况调整。',
		'The outbound flight takes about 80 minutes, according to the GetYourGuide option’s itinerary.' => '根据 GetYourGuide 选项的行程，去程航班约 80 分钟。',
		'The panoramic viewpoint' => '全景观景点',
		'The park is home to a great variety of plants and animals, and its coast and islands are important for nesting birds and sea turtles.' => '公园栖息着种类繁多的动植物，海岸和岛屿对鸟类和海龟繁殖十分重要。',
		'The park reaches about 50 km inland into the mountains of the Eastern Desert, with Gebel Hamata among the highest of them.' => '公园向内陆延伸约50公里，进入东部沙漠的群山，哈马塔山是其中最高的山峰之一。',
		'The park rules' => '公园规定',
		'The pyramids' => '金字塔',
		'The pyramids of Giza at sunset' => '夕阳下的吉萨金字塔',
		'The pyramids without moving hotels' => '不换酒店也能看金字塔',
		'The rescue' => '拯救',
		'The river as the highlight' => '以河流为亮点',
		'The round trip from Cairo takes a large share of the day, so most tours start early and focus on four or five sites. A private car with a guide lets you choose them. Tours differ in which sites they include, so compare the itineraries.' => '从开罗往返要占去一天的大部分时间，所以多数行程很早出发，集中游览四五个景点。包车配导游可以自己挑选景点。各行程包含的景点不同，请比较行程安排。',
		'The sea is warm for most of the year. Spring and autumn combine warm water with comfortable air temperatures.' => '一年中大部分时间海水都很温暖。春秋两季水温宜人，气温也舒适。',
		'The seafront promenade and the former royal gardens at its eastern end.' => '海滨长廊，以及其东端的前皇家花园。',
		'The show programme' => '表演内容',
		'The site is large and exposed, the approaches are crowded with touts, and the story behind the monuments doesn’t explain itself. A good guide handles tickets and the route across the plateau, keeps unwanted sellers at a distance, and turns the stones into the history of the Old Kingdom.' => '景区很大且无遮挡，入口处挤满了揽客的人，古迹背后的故事也不会自己讲出来。好导游会安排门票和高原上的路线，挡开不请自来的小贩，把石头讲成古王国的历史。',
		'The sources are listed as published, in their original language.' => '来源按原文发布的形式和语言列出。',
		'The story · {n} chapters' => '故事 · {n} 个篇章',
		'The sun festival' => '太阳奇观',
		'The tombs and temples' => '陵墓与神庙',
