		'Three great terraces built for the female pharaoh Hatshepsut, with reliefs of her divine birth and the expedition to the land of Punt.' => '为女法老哈特谢普苏特修建的三层宏伟平台，浮雕描绘了她神圣的诞生和前往蓬特之地的远征。',
