		'Travellers who want an easy, entertaining evening with a view, families, and groups. If you prefer quiet, a felucca ride at sunset, just the sail, the water and the city, may suit you better. Many visitors do both.' => '适合想度过一个轻松有趣、风景又好的夜晚的旅客，也适合家庭和团体。如果你更喜欢安静，日落时乘一趟三角帆船——只有风帆、河水和城市——可能更合你意。许多游客两样都会体验。',
		'Travellers who want landscape and adventure, and don’t mind simple camping without facilities. It’s not a luxury experience, and the drive from Cairo is long.' => '适合追求风景和冒险、不介意没有设施的简易露营的旅客。这不是奢华体验，从开罗出发的路程也很长。',
