		'Wildlife' => '野生动物',
		'With a licensed local operator and an experienced driver, yes. Don’t try to drive into the desert on your own.' => '有持证的当地经营者和经验丰富的司机，就是安全的。不要尝试自己开车进入沙漠。',
		'With more time, a few nights in Cairo let you see Giza, the museums and Historic Cairo at an easier pace.' => '时间更充裕的话，在开罗住几晚，就能以更从容的节奏游览吉萨、博物馆和开罗古城。',
		'With your guide, the High Dam and the temple of Philae on its island, before the boat sets off.' => '开船前，跟着导游参观阿斯旺高坝和岛上的菲莱神庙。',
		'Yes' => '是',
		'Yes, as a try-dive with an instructor, at shallow depth, after a briefing. You’ll need to be in reasonable health.' => '可以，在听完简报后，由教练陪同在浅水做体验潜水。你需要身体状况基本良好。',
		'Yes, but you’ll get much more from the tombs with one, especially on a first visit.' => '可以，但有导游讲解，你会从这些墓室中收获多得多，第一次来时尤其如此。',
		'Yes, if you have a spare day in Cairo. You will see the highlights, though staying a night gives a more relaxed visit.' => '如果你在开罗有一天空闲，那就值得。你能看到主要景点，不过在当地住一晚会让参观更从容。',
		'Yes, many operators offer an overnight camp in the dunes, for a night under the stars.' => '可以，许多经营者提供在沙丘间营地过夜的选择，让你在星空下度过一晚。',
		'Yes, the main sites. The options on this page take a full day, from about 12 to 16 hours, with hotel pickup.' => '可以，看主要景点。本页的选项需要一整天，约 12 到 16 小时，含酒店接送。',
		'Yes, up to 24 h before' => '可以，最晚提前24小时',
		'Yes, with an extra ticket. The ascending passages are narrow and steep, and the chamber inside is bare. Most visitors find the outside and the viewpoint more impressive.' => '可以，需要另外购票。上行通道狭窄陡峭，里面的墓室空无一物。大多数游客觉得外观和观景点更令人震撼。',
		'Yes, you can arrange your own driver or fly independently. Most travellers still book a tour or transfer for the pre-dawn road journey.' => '可以，你可以自己包车或自行搭乘航班。不过大多数旅客仍会为天亮前的陆路行程预订团队游或接送。',
		'Yes. It is a full day, and the option on this page picks you up at your hotel in Cairo or Giza.' => '可以。这是一整天的行程，本页的选项包含从你在开罗或吉萨的酒店接送。',
		'Yes. Koshari, ful, ta’meya and feteer are traditionally vegetarian. Tell your guide in advance.' => '适合。库莎丽、焖蚕豆、塔梅亚和千层饼传统上都是素食。请提前告诉导游。',
		'Yes. On all three options an Egyptologist guide leads the visits.' => '是的。三个选项的参观都由埃及学导游带领。',
		'Yes. The Civil Aviation Authority can cancel flights for wind or unstable weather, as it did on 13 March 2026. Keep a spare morning.' => '会。民航局可因大风或天气不稳取消飞行，例如 2026 年 3 月 13 日。请预留一个备用早晨。',
		'Yes. The options on this page fly you to Cairo and back in one day, with hotel pickup.' => '可以。本页的选项会在一天内带您乘飞机往返开罗，含酒店接送。',
		'Yes. Trains run between Cairo and Alexandria throughout the day, and you can move around the city by taxi or ride-hailing app.' => '可以。开罗和亚历山大之间全天都有火车，在城里可以打车或用叫车软件出行。',
		'Yes. UNESCO inscribed it in 2005, as Egypt’s natural World Heritage site.' => '是的。联合国教科文组织于2005年将其列入名录，它是埃及的自然世界遗产。',
		'You' => '您',
		'You <em>Feel</em> It' => '用心<em>感受</em>',
		'You are unsubscribed, and your address is deleted.' => '您已退订，您的地址已删除。',
		'You book and pay on Viator, GetYourGuide, Klook, Tiqets or Trip.com. Free cancellation is shown when the partner offers it.' => '您在 Viator、GetYourGuide、Klook、Tiqets 或 Trip.com 上预订并付款。合作伙伴提供免费取消时会注明。',
		'You book directly with our partners' => '您直接向我们的合作伙伴预订',
		'You can do a try-dive (introductory dive) with an instructor at shallow depth after a briefing. It’s a good way to find out whether diving is for you.' => '听完简报后，你可以在教练陪同下在浅水做一次“体验潜水”（入门潜水）。这是判断潜水是否适合你的好方法。',
		'You choose when you book: the Grand Egyptian Museum in Giza or the Egyptian Museum on Tahrir Square.' => '预订时选择：吉萨的大埃及博物馆，或解放广场的埃及博物馆。',
